{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 18,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 432.207,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did worship the Lord,",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.431,
      "end": 5.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did go forth with me;",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.376,
      "end": 8.255,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we did work timbers of curious workmanship.",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.435,
      "end": 11.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord did show me from time to time",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.355,
      "end": 14.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after what manner I should work the timbers of the ship.",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.239,
      "end": 17.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I, Nephi, did not work the timbers",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.927,
      "end": 20.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after the manner which was learned by men,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.94,
      "end": 24.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither did I build the ship after the manner of men;",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.417,
      "end": 29.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I did build it after the manner which the Lord had shown unto me;",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 29.52,
      "end": 32.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, it was not after the manner of men.",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 33.126,
      "end": 36.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, did go into the mount oft,",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 36.185,
      "end": 38.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did pray oft unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 38.733,
      "end": 41.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore the Lord showed unto me great things.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 42.153,
      "end": 47.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after I had finished the ship, according to the word of the Lord,",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.72,
      "end": 53.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my brethren beheld that it was good, and that the workmanship thereof was exceedingly fine;",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 53.798,
      "end": 57.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they did humble themselves again before the Lord.",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.24,
      "end": 62.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the voice of the Lord came unto my father,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 62.275,
      "end": 65.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should arise and go down into the ship.",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 65.927,
      "end": 68.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that on the morrow,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.243,
      "end": 70.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after we had prepared all things,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 70.42,
      "end": 72.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "much fruits and meat from the wilderness,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 73.061,
      "end": 74.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and honey in abundance,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 75.052,
      "end": 78.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and provisions according to that which the Lord had commanded us,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 78.947,
      "end": 83.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did go down into the ship, with all our loading and our seeds,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 83.26,
      "end": 85.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whatsoever thing we had brought with us,",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.041,
      "end": 87.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every one according to his age;",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.171,
      "end": 92.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, we did all go down into the ship, with our wives and our children.",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 93.263,
      "end": 96.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my father had begat two sons in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 96.787,
      "end": 99.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the elder was called Jacob and the younger Joseph.",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 100.671,
      "end": 104.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after we had all gone down into the ship,",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 104.334,
      "end": 109.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had taken with us our provisions and things which had been commanded us,",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.53,
      "end": 111.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did put forth into the sea",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 111.939,
      "end": 116.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were driven forth before the wind towards the promised land.",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 116.845,
      "end": 121.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after we had been driven forth before the wind for the space of many days,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 121.948,
      "end": 126.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, my brethren and the sons of Ishmael and also their wives",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 127.004,
      "end": 132.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "began to make themselves merry, insomuch that they began to dance, and to sing,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 132.292,
      "end": 134.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to speak with much rudeness,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 134.515,
      "end": 136.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even that they did forget",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 136.971,
      "end": 139.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by what power they had been brought thither;",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 139.566,
      "end": 142.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they were lifted up unto exceeding rudeness.",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 143.032,
      "end": 147.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, began to fear exceedingly lest the Lord should be angry with us,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 147.763,
      "end": 150.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and smite us because of our iniquity,",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 150.683,
      "end": 154.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should be swallowed up in the depths of the sea;",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 154.439,
      "end": 158.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I, Nephi, began to speak to them with much soberness;",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 158.845,
      "end": 161.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold they were angry with me, saying:",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 161.44,
      "end": 164.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We will not that our younger brother shall be a ruler over us.",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 165.557,
      "end": 170.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Laman and Lemuel did take me and bind me with cords,",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 170.985,
      "end": 173.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did treat me with much harshness;",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 173.348,
      "end": 175.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, the Lord did suffer it",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 176.175,
      "end": 181.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might show forth his power, unto the fulfilling of his word",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 181.324,
      "end": 183.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he had spoken concerning the wicked.",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 184.605,
      "end": 189.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after they had bound me insomuch that I could not move,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 189.615,
      "end": 193.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the compass, which had been prepared of the Lord, did cease to work.",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 194.567,
      "end": 198.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, they knew not whither they should steer the ship,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 198.602,
      "end": 201.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that there arose a great storm,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 201.476,
      "end": 204.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a great and terrible tempest,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 204.21,
      "end": 208.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we were driven back upon the waters for the space of three days;",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 208.709,
      "end": 211.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to be frightened exceedingly",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 211.583,
      "end": 214.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they should be drowned in the sea;",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 214.271,
      "end": 216.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they did not loose me.",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 217.087,
      "end": 220.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And on the fourth day, which we had been driven back,",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 220.378,
      "end": 222.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the tempest began to be exceedingly sore.",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 223.473,
      "end": 227.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we were about to be swallowed up in the depths of the sea.",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 228.111,
      "end": 232.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after we had been driven back upon the waters for the space of four days,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 232.935,
      "end": 236.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my brethren began to see that the judgments of God were upon them,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.877,
      "end": 238.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they must perish",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 238.775,
      "end": 242.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save that they should repent of their iniquities;",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 242.392,
      "end": 244.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they came unto me,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 244.522,
      "end": 247.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and loosed the bands which were upon my wrists,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 247.581,
      "end": 249.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold they had swollen exceedingly;",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 250.129,
      "end": 252.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also mine ankles were much swollen,",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 253.142,
      "end": 255.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great was the soreness thereof.",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 256.051,
      "end": 258.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, I did look unto my God,",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 258.832,
      "end": 261.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did praise him all the day long;",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 261.473,
      "end": 265.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did not murmur against the Lord because of mine afflictions.",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 266.24,
      "end": 269.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now my father, Lehi, had said many things unto them,",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 269.903,
      "end": 272.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also unto the sons of Ishmael;",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 272.359,
      "end": 276.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but, behold, they did breathe out much threatenings",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 276.347,
      "end": 278.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "against anyone that should speak for me;",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 278.895,
      "end": 281.681,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my parents being stricken in years,",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 281.861,
      "end": 289.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having suffered much grief because of their children, they were brought down, yea, even upon their sick-beds.",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 290.157,
      "end": 292.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Because of their grief and much sorrow,",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 292.798,
      "end": 295.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the iniquity of my brethren,",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 295.207,
      "end": 299.526,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were brought near even to be carried out of this time to meet their God;",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 299.706,
      "end": 305.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, their grey hairs were about to be brought down to lie low in the dust;",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 305.877,
      "end": 310.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even they were near to be cast with sorrow into a watery grave.",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 311.48,
      "end": 314.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Jacob and Joseph also, being young,",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 314.261,
      "end": 319.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having need of much nourishment, were grieved because of the afflictions of their mother;",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 320.014,
      "end": 324.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my wife with her tears and prayers, and also my children,",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 324.745,
      "end": 328.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did not soften the hearts of my brethren that they would loose me.",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 328.954,
      "end": 336.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was nothing save it were the power of God, which threatened them with destruction, could soften their hearts;",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 337.168,
      "end": 342.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, when they saw that they were about to be swallowed up in the depths of the sea",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 342.828,
      "end": 347.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they repented of the thing which they had done, insomuch that they loosed me.",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 348.431,
      "end": 352.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after they had loosed me, behold, I took the compass,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 352.791,
      "end": 355.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it did work whither I desired it.",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 355.386,
      "end": 358.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I prayed unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 358.631,
      "end": 360.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after I had prayed",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 360.436,
      "end": 361.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the winds did cease,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 362.056,
      "end": 363.681,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the storm did cease,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 363.861,
      "end": 365.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was a great calm.",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 366.445,
      "end": 369.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, did guide the ship,",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 370.015,
      "end": 373.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we sailed again towards the promised land.",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 373.853,
      "end": 378.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after we had sailed for the space of many days",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 378.491,
      "end": 380.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did arrive at the promised land;",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 380.854,
      "end": 382.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we went forth upon the land,",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 383.077,
      "end": 384.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did pitch our tents;",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 385.161,
      "end": 387.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we did call it the promised land.",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 388.024,
      "end": 391.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did begin to till the earth,",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 391.455,
      "end": 393.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we began to plant seeds;",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 393.725,
      "end": 396.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we did put all our seeds into the earth,",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 396.691,
      "end": 399.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which we had brought from the land of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 399.611,
      "end": 402.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did grow exceedingly;",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 402.763,
      "end": 405.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, we were blessed in abundance.",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 405.811,
      "end": 409.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did find upon the land of promise,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 409.753,
      "end": 411.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as we journeyed in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 412.116,
      "end": 417.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there were beasts in the forests of every kind, both the cow and the ox,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 417.358,
      "end": 419.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the ass and the horse,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 419.535,
      "end": 421.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the goat and the wild goat,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 421.851,
      "end": 424.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of wild animals,",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 424.214,
      "end": 426.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were for the use of men.",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 426.53,
      "end": 431.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we did find all manner of ore, both of gold, and of silver, and of copper.",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 127
    }
  ]
}